d enjoy all the series staples you've come to expect from Way of the Samurai:<br><br>•\tBranching storylines with multiple endings<br>•\tDynamic combat system<br>•\tVast array of melee and gunpowder weaponry<br>•\tExtensive character customization<br>•\tKey event decision making<br>•\tSword collecting<br>•\tOriginal Japanese voiceover with English subtitles<br><br>This PC conversion also features a number of improvements over the original, ensuring that PC gamers receive the best gaming experience possible:<br><br>•\tImproved user interface with both gamepad and keyboard support<br>•\t8 stunning Steam Trading Cards to collect!<br>•\tSteam Achievements<br>•\tCloud Saves<br><br><strong><u>What the reviewers had to say about the PS3 version</u></strong><br> “Ridiculously over-the-top Japanese historical setting combined with samurai badassery and an open-world, Choose Your Own Adventure–style interface.” - <strong>EGM</strong><br><br>“I can recommend this game to anyone who is a diehard fan of samurais and enjoys a good combat system wrapped around a unique way of telling a story.” - <strong>Darkstation</strong><br><br>“...a unique, rewarding experience that to date, can't be found anywhere else.” – <strong>Destructoid</strong>",
